  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">위 </span><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">가지 사례를 저희 학교 생기부 전문가 선생님께 보여드리고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">얻은 팁을 공유합니다</span><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">1. 종합의견을 작성하기 전에</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">생기부를 출력하여 출결</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">수상</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">봉사</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">교과세특을 한 번 읽어보세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">이런 내용을 바탕으로 종합의견을 작성하는 것이 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">한 학생에 대한 종합적인 의견을 담는 비결입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--> </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">제가 작성한 것은 한 학생의 성장스토리라기 보다는 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">분절적인 관찰과 평가의 기록이라는 한계가 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">좀 더 체계적인 기록의 방법이 있을까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">--&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">종합의견을 크게 세부분 정도로 구분해보세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">첫 번째 부분 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학업과 관련된 기록</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">가운데 부분 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">인 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">역할과 같이 학급에 대한 기록</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">마지막 부분 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">진로와 관련 이야기</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">                  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">종합적인 평가 및 발전 가능성을 종합적으로 작성해주세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">기록 내용이 추상적인 내용이어서 설득력이 적은 것 같습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">추상직인 기록의 예 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">사교성이 좋고 성격이 활달하여 인간관계를 잘 맺고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">                       </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">남녀 모든 학생들과 폭넓은 교우관계를 유지함</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">                       </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">어려운 친구를 잘 도와주고 맡은 일에 책임감이 강한 학생임</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">--&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">추상적인</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">분석적인</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">내용</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">종합적인 판단에 근거한 기록을 하는 것은 당연합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">이 추상적인 내용의 증거가 될 수 있는 구체적인 사례를 한 가지씩 살짝 살짝 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">넣어주면 더 좋겠습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">예를 들어 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">반에서 맡은 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">인</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">역할인 '중간청소' 역할을 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">년간 충실히 수행하는 성실성과 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">책임의식이 높은 학생임</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 163%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-sp